<title>CHINA: China Jan-Aug trade surplus $4.99 bln-customs.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Aug trade surplus $4.99 bln-customs.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's trade surplus for the first eight months was $4.99 billion, compared with $15.27 billion in the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Saturday.</p>
<p>		 Jan-Aug 1996	    Jan-Aug 1995</p>
<p> Exports	 90.61			94.61</p>
<p> Imports	 85.62			79.33</p>
<p> Balance	+ 4.99		     +15.27</p>
<p>(Figures are in billions of U.S. dollars)</p>
</text>
